CROCbox — The Reference Implementation of the Human Consent Layer for OpenClaw

Copyright 2026 Opnli Corporation (opn.li)

This software implements the Human Consent Layer (HCL) specification.
See: https://github.com/mikeoz/human-consent-layer

Certain enforcement mechanisms used in this implementation are the subject of
Provisional Patent Application #63/992,579, filed February 27, 2026.
These mechanisms are abstracted behind clean interfaces in this open-source
release. The HCL specification, consent flow, audit chain, and five-choice
consent model are open and available for any implementation.

Part of the Open Consent project: https://github.com/mikeoz/open-consent
